Additional runtime helper:

Add `smtinel-yield-cost-impact-runtime-v1` before `</body>` to compute visible Cost Impact from Station_on_line_report / SKU Cost columns and render a Business Impact card at the top of Yield Flow. It indexes Cost by `BU + Product Family + Version`, `Product Family + Version`, and `Product Family`, then estimates exposed cost as `risk/fail qty x unit cost` and flags missing cost rows.
